        "sources": [
          "nextcrm",
          "espocrm",
          "suitecrm"
        ],
        "confidence": "medium",
        "notes": "Verified in two implementations: SuiteCRM models this as ProspectLists joined to Prospects/Contacts/Leads and attached to Campaigns; EspoCRM as TargetList with the same many-to-many shape. Both treat membership as a list, which is why a dynamic 'smart segment' is a separate, weaker claim."
      }
